{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35861","headline":"同友人秋日登庾楼 · 李咸用","name":"同友人秋日登庾楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兰摧菊暗不胜秋，倚着高楼思莫收。\n六代风光无问处，九条烟水但凝愁。\n谁能百岁长闲去，秪个孤帆岂自由。\n欲学仲宣知是否，臂弓腰剑逐时流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}